@title Monorepo deployment pipeline
@subtitle Developer Productivity · Quillstone Software · as of 2026-10-10

# Pipeline diagram

diagram pipe dir=LR title="Deployment pipeline"
pipe: pr "Pull Request" user
pipe: test "Lint and Unit Tests" svc
pipe: build "Build Image" svc
pipe: scan "Security Scan" svc
pipe: stage "Deploy to Staging" svc
pipe: smoke "Smoke Tests" svc
pipe: approve "Manual Approval" team
pipe: canary "Canary 10%" svc
pipe: full "Full Rollout" svc
pipe: rollback "Auto Rollback" fn
pipe: pr -> test
pipe: test -> build : pass
pipe: build -> scan
pipe: scan -> stage : no critical CVEs
pipe: stage -> smoke
pipe: smoke -> approve : pass
pipe: approve -> canary : approved
pipe: canary -> full : healthy 30 min
pipe: canary -> rollback : error rate above 1%

# Stage durations

data stages = Stage,Median (min),p90 (min); Lint and Unit Tests,7.5,13.4; Build Image,4.2,6.9; Security Scan,2.8,4.1; Deploy to Staging,3.1,5.0; Smoke Tests,5.6,9.8; Canary 10%,30,30; Full Rollout,12,18

chart hbar stages y=Median (min) unit=min labels title="Median duration per stage"

table stages

# Rules

- Manual Approval is required only for services tagged tier-1.
- Friday deploys after 15:00 local time are blocked.
- Auto Rollback pages the owning team.
